    63|## GIF Export
    64|
    65|### saveGif()
    66|
    67|```javascript
    68|function keyPressed() {
    69|  if (key === 'g' || key === 'G') {
    70|    saveGif('output', 5);
    71|    // Captures 5 seconds of animation
    72|    // Options: saveGif(filename, duration, options)
    73|  }
    74|}
    75|
    76|// With options
    77|saveGif('output', 5, {
