   330|## SVG Export
   331|
   332|### Using p5.js-svg Library
   333|
   334|```html
   335|<script src="https://unpkg.com/p5.js-svg@1.5.1"></script>
   336|```
   337|
   338|```javascript
   339|function setup() {
   340|  createCanvas(1920, 1080, SVG);  // SVG renderer
   341|  noLoop();
   342|}
   343|
   344|function draw() {
   345|  // Only vector operations (no pixels, no blend modes)
   346|  stroke(0);
   347|  noFill();
   348|  for (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {
   349|    let x = random(width);
   350|    let y = random(height);
   351|    ellipse(x, y, random(10, 50));
   352|  }
   353|  save('output.svg');
   354|}
   355|```
   356|
   357|Limitations:
   358|- No `loadPixels()`, `updatePixels()`, `filter()`, `blendMode()`
   359|- No WebGL
   360|- No pixel-level effects
   361|- Great for: line art, geometric patterns, plots
   362|
   363|### Hybrid: Raster Background + SVG Overlay
   364|
   365|Render background effects to PNG, then SVG for crisp vector elements on top.
   366|
   367|## Export Format Decision Guide
   368|
   369|| Need | Format | Method |
   370||------|--------|--------|
   371|| Single still image | PNG | `saveCanvas()` or `keyPressed()` |
   372|| Print-quality still | PNG (high-res) | `pixelDensity(1)` + large canvas |
   373|| Short animated loop | GIF | `saveGif()` |
   374|| Long animation | MP4 | Frame sequence + ffmpeg |
   375|| Social media video | MP4 | `scripts/render.sh` |
   376|| Vector/print | SVG | p5.js-svg renderer |
   377|| Batch variations | PNG sequence | Seed loop + `saveCanvas()` |
   378|| Interactive deployment | HTML | Single self-contained file |
   379|| Headless rendering | PNG/MP4 | Puppeteer + ffmpeg |
   380|
   381|## Tiling for Ultra-High-Resolution
   382|
   383|For resolutions too large for a single canvas (e.g., 10000x10000 for print):
   384|
   385|```javascript
   386|function renderTiled(totalW, totalH, tileSize) {
   387|  let cols = ceil(totalW / tileSize);
   388|  let rows = ceil(totalH / tileSize);
   389|
   390|  for (let ty = 0; ty < rows; ty++) {
   391|    for (let tx = 0; tx < cols; tx++) {
   392|      let buffer = createGraphics(tileSize, tileSize);
   393|      buffer.push();
   394|      buffer.translate(-tx * tileSize, -ty * tileSize);
   395|      renderScene(buffer, totalW, totalH);
   396|      buffer.pop();
   397|      buffer.save(`tile-${tx}-${ty}.png`);
   398|      buffer.remove();  // free memory
   399|    }
   400|  }
   401|  // Stitch with ImageMagick:
   402|  // montage tile-*.png -tile 4x4 -geometry +0+0 final.png
   403|}
   404|```
